00:04:50.356 --> 00:04:54.027 align:start size:97% position:3%
Like our constitution says,
a more perfect nation,

00:04:54.027 --> 00:04:55.528
not a perfect nation.

00:04:55.528 --> 00:04:58.865
We should be striving to
be more perfect every day.

00:04:58.865 --> 00:05:02.368
