everybody and all that?

00:05:44.210 --> 00:05:46.045
- Our history is not told right.

00:05:46.045 --> 00:05:48.214 align:start size:88% position:13%
So I started collecting
these things.

00:05:48.214 --> 00:05:51.918 align:start size:84% position:16%
We now have more
