We just bought a
massive collection that

00:06:06.199 --> 00:06:08.434 align:start size:88% position:13%
I mean, the Smithsonian
was in the running.

00:06:08.434 --> 00:06:10.136
I mean, it's massive.

00:06:11.337 --> 00:06:15.074 align:start size:81% position:19%
That is all of the
Pilgrim history

00:06:15.074 --> 00:06:17.677
and all of the history of
